    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, balance, and protect your coral reef  ecosystem.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Coraland</i> is a unique simulation and strategy game where you take on the role of a marine biologist tasked with restoring and protecting a fragile coral reef. Every coral you place, every fish that spawns, and every structure you build affects the ecosystem, for better or worse.\u00a0<strong>Grow a dynamic reef:</strong> Place corals like Montipora, Acropora, and Gorgonians to provide shelter and structure for marine life.</p>",
